      "message": "wallet: cleanse the hasher in BytesToKeySHA512AES\n\nAfter the loop, the CSHA512 `di` still holds the derived key and IV in\nits state, and the previous round's digest in its buffer. `buf` is\ncleansed before the function returns, but `di` is left on the stack.\n\nCleanse it the same way as the `hkdf` object in the BIP324 cipher.",
